# Generated files are written byte-for-byte by their generators (ts-rs, xtask
# fixtures), always with LF. Without this, a Windows checkout under
# core.autocrlf=true materialises them as CRLF, and the moment a gate
# regenerates them all 35 show as phantom-modified with an empty diff --
# inviting either a pointless commit or a reflex `checkout --` that one day
# discards a real regeneration.
crates/zest-proto/bindings/** text eol=lf
crates/zest-proto/fixtures/** text eol=lf
schemas/** text eol=lf
